    "detailed_description": "Slotgun is a satisfying deckbuilding slot-machine game where you face off against several CPU opponents to control the board. <br><br>Roll you deck and control a cannon by timing your clicks to play the slot gun machine. Your roll will determine whether you shoot a single shot or thousands of balls. Your goal? Hit blocks to turn them into your color and dominate the board.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Craft</strong> your slot machine deck with a growing collection of symbols. Every symbol changes the way your cannon will fire and how many shots it will fire.<br></li><li><strong>Combine</strong> specific symbols for special events that can improve your deck or change the entire course of the game.<br></li><li><strong>Control</strong> the board by turning everything to your color!<br></li><li><strong>Do It Again.</strong> Multiple modes, difficulties, number of enemies, and random events make the game infinitely replayable. </li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Slotgun is a satisfying deckbuilding slot-machine game where you face off against several CPU opponents to control the board. <br><br>Roll you deck and control a cannon by timing your clicks to play the slot gun machine. Your roll will determine whether you shoot a single shot or thousands of balls. Your goal? Hit blocks to turn them into your color and dominate the board.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Craft</strong> your slot machine deck with a growing collection of symbols. Every symbol changes the way your cannon will fire and how many shots it will fire.<br></li><li><strong>Combine</strong> specific symbols for special events that can improve your deck or change the entire course of the game.<br></li><li><strong>Control</strong> the board by turning everything to your color!<br></li><li><strong>Do It Again.</strong> Multiple modes, difficulties, number of enemies, and random events make the game infinitely replayable. </li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Slot Gun is a satisfying deckbuilding slot-machine game where you face off against several opponents to control the board. It is a blend of luck and skill where timing is key and dopamine is everywhere.",
